{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"お久しぶりです。\n新内眞衣です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遂に全国ツアーが始まり\nバタバタとした日々を過ごしてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ始まったばかりですが、\n体調や怪我に気をつけて頑張りたいと\n思います(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この夏は乃木坂と熱い夏にしましょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/07/4723763/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"UPDATE girls"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7/31に発売されました〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"創刊号に大きく取り上げて貰って\n嬉しい限りです(T_T)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/07/4723763/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/07/4723763/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はこの雑誌の担当の方が\nもっと新内さんに合う感じで\nグラビアを撮りたいと言って下さり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はモデルさんっぽく\n撮って頂きました(T_T)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/07/4723763/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影で初めておデコを出したり\n高いお洋服を着させてもらったり\nモードっぽくして貰い\nなかなかない経験だったな〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また違った一面を見て\n貰えたら幸せです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/07/4723763/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/07/4723763/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{